esenting the annotation.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A view conforming to the "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNCalloutView","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol, or "},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to use the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"default callout view."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If this method is present in the delegate, it must return a new instance of a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"view dedicated to display the callout. The returned view will be configured by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the map view."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If this method is absent from the delegate, or if it returns ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", a standard,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"two-line, bubble-like callout view is displayed by default.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":4,"type":"heading","anchor":"Related-examples","text":"Related examples"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TODO: Display custom views as callouts, learn how to customize an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotation","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object’s "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotation","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/M